{"parse":{"title":"Plan to Get Paid","pageid":420875,"revid":2073609,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Plan to Get Paid</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fb/Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png/revision/latest?cb=20251203174021\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Plan to Get Paid\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fb/Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png/revision/latest?cb=20251203174021\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fb/Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png/revision/latest?cb=20251203174021 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fb/Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png/revision/latest?cb=20251203174021 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Plan to Get Paid\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Plan to Get Paid.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jahoda\" title=\"Jahoda\">Jahoda</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When your team has at least one <span class=\"text-pyro\"><b>Pyro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>, or <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span> character, the <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">One of the gadgets that Jahoda — a former treasure hunter — carries around with her. It is deployed upon using her Elemental Burst Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter.<br />Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots continuously restore HP to your active character. If the healed character's HP is above 70%, they also restore HP to the nearby party member with the lowest HP.<br /><br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: If nearby opponents are affected by <span class=\"text-pyro\"><b>Pyro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>, or <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span>, Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots will convert to that element. The order of priority that determines which element will be converted to is: <span class=\"text-pyro\"><b>Pyro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>, then <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span>. After each deployment, a Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robot can undergo one such conversion. After converting, the Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robot will periodically attack up to 3 nearby opponents, dealing damage of the corresponding element.</span></span></span> from the Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Hidden_Aces:_Seven_Tools_of_the_Hunter\" title=\"Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter\">Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter</a> will be enhanced based on the number of characters of each corresponding element.<br />Jahoda secretly keeps track of these characters. Among them, the element with the highest number of characters determines the enhancement effect:<br /><ul><li> <span class=\"text-pyro\"><b>Pyro</b></span>: Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots deal 130% of their original DMG.</li><li> <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro</b></span>: Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots <a href=\"/wiki/Heal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heal\">heal</a> for 120% of their original <a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\">healing</a> amount.</li><li> <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>: The number of Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots increases by one.</li><li> <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span>: The attack interval of Purrsonal Coordinated Assistance Robots is reduced by 10%.</li></ul><br />If there's a tie between elements, the order of priority that determines which enhancement takes effect is: <span class=\"text-pyro\"><b>Pyro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>, then <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span>. Only one elemental effect can initially be triggered.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Plan to Get Paid</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Jahoda\" title=\"Jahoda\">Jahoda</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPlan_to_Get_Paid%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Plan to Get Paid</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">索酬的巧计</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">索酬的巧計</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">報酬ゲットの妙案</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">수금</span> <span lang=\"ko\">기술</span><br /><small><i>Sugeum Gisul</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Argucia remunerativa</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Plan pour toucher sa r<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>compense</td><td>Plan to Receive One's Reward</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Остроумный</span> <span lang=\"ru\">план</span> <span lang=\"ru\">истребования</span> <span lang=\"ru\">оплаты</span><br /><small><i>Ostroumnyy plan istrebovaniya oplaty</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Plan to Get Paid</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Diệu Kế Đòi Thù Lao</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Listiger Belohnungsplan</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Plan to Get Paid</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Plano de Recompensas</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td><span lang=\"tr\">Ö</span>deme Alma Takti<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>i</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Obiettivo: Stipendio</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPlan_to_Get_Paid%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_III\" title=\"Version/Luna III\">Version \"Luna III\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Plan_to_Get_Paid/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Luna+III%22&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Plan+to+Get+Paid\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPlan_to_Get_Paid%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left\">&#160;</div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constellation\" title=\"Constellation\">Constellations</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Jahoda\" title=\"Jahoda\">Jahoda</a></span></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0px;text-align: center;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; vertical-align: top;\">\n<tbody><tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Normal </small><br /><b>Attack</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_While_the_Arrow%27s_Hot\" title=\"Strike While the Arrow&#39;s Hot\"><img alt=\"Bow Anemo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Bow Anemo.png\" data-image-key=\"Bow_Anemo.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5b/Bow_Anemo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20210607085607\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_While_the_Arrow%27s_Hot\" title=\"Strike While the Arrow&#39;s Hot\">Strike While the Arrow's Hot</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Skill</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Savvy_Strategy:_Splitting_the_Spoils\" title=\"Savvy Strategy: Splitting the Spoils\"><img alt=\"Talent Savvy Strategy Splitting the Spoils\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Savvy Strategy Splitting the Spoils.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Savvy_Strategy_Splitting_the_Spoils.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/80/Talent_Savvy_Strategy_Splitting_the_Spoils.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251203174011\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Savvy_Strategy:_Splitting_the_Spoils\" title=\"Savvy Strategy: Splitting the Spoils\">Savvy Strategy: Splitting the Spoils</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Burst</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hidden_Aces:_Seven_Tools_of_the_Hunter\" title=\"Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter\"><img alt=\"Talent Hidden Aces Seven Tools of the Hunter\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Hidden Aces Seven Tools of the Hunter.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Hidden_Aces_Seven_Tools_of_the_Hunter.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/9d/Talent_Hidden_Aces_Seven_Tools_of_the_Hunter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251203174018\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Hidden_Aces:_Seven_Tools_of_the_Hunter\" title=\"Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter\">Hidden Aces: Seven Tools of the Hunter</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>1st Ascension </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Plan_to_Get_Paid\" title=\"Plan to Get Paid\"><img alt=\"Talent Plan to Get Paid\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Plan to Get Paid.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fb/Talent_Plan_to_Get_Paid.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251203174021\" /></a></span><br /><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Plan to Get Paid</strong></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>4th Ascension </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Berry_Bounty\" title=\"Sweet Berry Bounty\"><img alt=\"Talent Sweet Berry Bounty\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Sweet Berry Bounty.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Sweet_Berry_Bounty.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f6/Talent_Sweet_Berry_Bounty.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251203174014\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Berry_Bounty\" title=\"Sweet Berry Bounty\">Sweet Berry Bounty</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Moonsign Benediction </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rooftop_Dash\" title=\"Rooftop Dash\"><img alt=\"Talent Rooftop Dash\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Rooftop Dash.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Rooftop_Dash.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/aa/Talent_Rooftop_Dash.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20251203174023\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Rooftop_Dash\" title=\"Rooftop Dash\">Rooftop Dash</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Utility </small><br /><b>Passive</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Backstreet_Guile\" title=\"Backstreet Guile\"><img alt=\"Talent Backstreet Guile\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element laz